  npcID: crisostomo_ibarra
  displayName: Crisostomo Ibarra
  characterFullName: "Juan Cris\xF3stomo Ibarra y Magsalin"
  alias: "Don Cris\xF3stomo"
  characterCategory: Protagonist / Filipino Ilustrado
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  description: "A courteous and educated young Filipino who returns home after seven
    years of study and travel in Europe. He is the son of the late Don Rafael Ibarra
    and is deeply troubled by the mystery surrounding his father\u2019s death."
  biography: "Juan Cris\xF3stomo Ibarra y Magsalin returns to the Philippines after
    spending nearly seven years in Europe. Capit\xE1n Tiago introduces him as the
    son of his deceased friend, Don Rafael Ibarra. Ibarra is surprised by Fray D\xE1maso\u2019s
    cold reception because he remembers the friar as a frequent guest and apparent
    friend of his father. Although D\xE1maso insults his education during dinner,
    Ibarra restrains his anger, responds respectfully and leaves before the dispute
    can worsen."
  characterFacts:
  - He is the son of Don Rafael Ibarra.
  - He has recently returned from Europe.
  - He was away from the Philippines for almost seven years.
  - He spent time in Germany, Russian Poland and England.
  - He is described as tall, healthy and youthful.
  - His appearance shows faint traces of Spanish ancestry.
  introductionLines: []
  repeatDialogues: []
